<title>HONDURAS: Honduras posts 1996 trade deficit of $462.9 mln.</title>
<headline>Honduras posts 1996 trade deficit of $462.9 mln.</headline>
<dateline>TEGUCIGALPA 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Honduras posted a trade deficit of $462.9 million in 1996, compared to a deficit of $422.5 million a year earlier, the central bank said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Exports in 1996 were $1.276 billion, compared to imports of $1.739 billion, it said.</p>
<p>Exports rose $55.4 million in 1996 from the year before, while imports rose $95.8 million in the same time frame, the central bank said.</p>
<p>((-- Honduras bureau, +504 32 78 98))</p>
</text>
